      "size": 10.94657039642334,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        722.1240234375,
        527.1572875976562,
        735.26904296875
      ],
      "text": "compared with smear microscopy and culture, are presented in Web Annexes  B.1–B.4.",
